AB  - This paper explores the transformative impact Agentic Artificial Intelligence (AI) can bring into DevOps, mainly in automation, collaboration, and decision-making. We combine controlled experiments and real deployment in a fintech setting to show that the integration of Agentic AI into CI/CD pipelines drastically reduces deployment times, detects errors better, and encourages multi-disciplinary collaboration. Our results show a 36% reduction in test cycle time and a 65% decrease in rollback frequency. Deployment assurance was rated a high 4.6/5 from developers when using the AI assistant-giving developers' confidence in this assistant. This paper offers practical guidelines and architectural blueprints for organizations intending to implement Agentic AI, followed by discussions on factors of ethical, operational, and technical concern for building explainable and trustworthy AI systems.
ER  - 

